contentText:
Meghan Trainor knows a lot of people&#8217;s lips are movin&#8217; about the rumored drama between herself, Ashley Tisdale and Hilary Duff .

On Thursday (Jan. 8), the singer broke her silence on the subject by sharing a TikTok. In the video, she frantically types on a computer keyboard with a confused look on her face.

